Closes #468.

## What
- **Stop**: `POST /api/repos/:o/:r/agents/stop {ids?, path?, harness?, lines?}` (owner only). It stops every running run that matches all of the filters given; with no filter it stops every one on the repo. For each run it:
  - marks it `stopped` in D1;
  - kills the local CLI (an `AbortSignal` goes through `Sandbox`/`Exec` to the process);
