Mythic Masters: orbit-and-commit combat round, one PR (Part of #2945, #2943)
One integrated PR, from main, replacing five PRs that touched the same files and had started to stack: #2944 (squash and stretch, sparks, skeleton limits, Black Shuck flame), #2946 (weight you can see), #2948 (orbit movement and shoulder camera), #2949 (bot that circles, baits and punishes recovery), #2950 (weighty attacks). Merging this one PR instead of those five avoids conflicts and the wrong merge order; those five get closed as superseded.

What it does: you circle the opponent and face them the whole way round; heavy attacks wind up, can't be cancelled, spend stamina and leave you open;

